id: pm-linear-fkps
title: The release changelog remained Unreleased after the release tag was created
description: "The daily release committed CHANGELOG.md before creating its release tag, leaving an Unreleased heading that changelog:check rejects once the tag exists. Regenerate the committed changelog with the release tag present so main and pull request gates agree with generated output."
