comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-30T14:48:39.265Z",pi-agent,"Regenerated CHANGELOG.md with npm run changelog:full after the 2026.8.29 tag existed. Validation: npm run changelog:check passed with output:"
  "2026-08-30T15:14:30.558Z",pi-agent,"Correction: the prior validation comment should end after 'passed'; the empty 'with output:' suffix is withdrawn. npm run changelog:check exited successfully."
close_reason: "Regenerated CHANGELOG.md with the release tag present and verified npm run changelog:check passes."
